  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Taking the potential at a large distance from the planet as zero, the potential at the centre of the planet <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GM</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math>.<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mv</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mtext><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GM</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">GM</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Rg</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8658;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">RG</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext>e</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8757;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathM